    </div>
</section>

<section class="section" id="about">
    <h2>📽️ About MovieZone</h2>

    <div class="details">
        <p>MovieZone is a movie review and rating website.</p>
        <p>Explore popular movies and discover different genres.</p>
        <p>Read movie summaries, cast details and critic reviews.</p>
        <p>Find your next favourite movie with MovieZone!</p>
    </div>
</section>

<footer>
    <p>© 2026 MovieZone - Movie Review Website</p>
    <p>Watch Movies | Read Reviews | Share Ratings</p>
</footer>

</body>
</html>
